1. KiDS mass bins: the coherent mode is degenerate with the amplitude; the differential mode is not
====================================================================================================================
  canonical  COHERENT (same eps in all 4 bins), amplitude profiled: eps=0 chi2 127.4/60 (amp +0.15); eps=0.1: -13.7 (amp +0.10), eps=0.2: -20.7 (amp +0.05), eps=0.5: -28.8 (amp -0.03), eps=1.0: -31.6 (amp -0.13), eps=1.5: -31.8 (amp -0.20)
  canonical  the same coherent test with the amplitude FIXED at 1: eps=0 chi2 269.2, eps=1 339.7 (Delta +70.5) -- the preference is the amplitude, not the halo
  canonical  DIFFERENTIAL (one bin at a time): bin 1 eps=1.0: +160, bin 1 eps=0.5: +66, bin 2 eps=1.0: +164, bin 2 eps=0.5: +57, bin 3 eps=1.0: +200, bin 3 eps=0.5: +80, bin 4 eps=1.0: +143, bin 4 eps=0.5: +55
  alt        COHERENT (same eps in all 4 bins), amplitude profiled: eps=0 chi2 126.0/60 (amp +0.11); eps=0.1: -13.4 (amp +0.05), eps=0.2: -20.3 (amp +0.02), eps=0.5: -28.0 (amp -0.07), eps=1.0: -30.6 (amp -0.17), eps=1.5: -30.8 (amp -0.24)
  alt        the same coherent test with the amplitude FIXED at 1: eps=0 chi2 208.6, eps=1 537.5 (Delta +329.0) -- the preference is the amplitude, not the halo
  alt        DIFFERENTIAL (one bin at a time): bin 1 eps=1.0: +159, bin 1 eps=0.5: +66, bin 2 eps=1.0: +163, bin 2 eps=0.5: +57, bin 3 eps=1.0: +200, bin 3 eps=0.5: +80, bin 4 eps=1.0: +143, bin 4 eps=0.5: +55
  [PASS] X1 (the correction) the four KiDS mass bins do NOT forbid a coherent CDM-like halo: with the amplitude profiled they PREFER eps ~ 1 by Delta chi2 <= -25, both footings -- a coherent halo and a coherent stellar-mass shift are degenerate   (canonical: best -31.8 at amp -0.20 dex; alt: best -30.8 at amp -0.24 dex)
  [PASS] X2 ...and with the amplitude held fixed the same halo is disfavoured, both footings: the entire preference lives in the +/-0.3 dex nuisance   (canonical: 269 -> 340; alt: 209 -> 538)
  [PASS] X3 the DIFFERENTIAL bound is real and strong: giving ONE mass bin a full CDM-like halo while the others have none costs Delta chi2 >= +100, every bin, both footings -- the halo-to-baryon ratio cannot vary from bin to bin   (min +143)

